Microsoft Excel
Excel is a software used to store and calculate data in table format.
Microsoft Excel is a spreadsheet software developed by Microsoft that is used to:
•	Store data
•	Organize data
•	Perform calculations
•	Analyse information
•	Create reports and charts.
History of Microsoft Excel
 Before Excel  
VisiCalc (1979)
•	First electronic spreadsheet
•	Worked on Apple computers
•	Changed how businesses handled calculations
Then came:
Lotus 1-2-3 (1983)
•	Very popular in offices
•	Ran on MS-DOS
•	Dominated the market in the 1980
 Birth of Excel
Microsoft launched Excel in 1985.
•	First version Apple Macintosh (1985)
•	 Later it came to Windows version released in 1987
That’s when Excel became very powerful because Windows became popular.




